Subject: [PATCH] Coach Ops Phase 1 + admin multi-page refactor

- Admin dashboard: split the single long page into a page-nav shell
  (Overview, Subscribers, Invites, Beta Users, Beta Codes, Waitlist,
  Feedback, Marketing, Coach Ops). All existing handlers/sections/
  components preserved; only navigation changed. Build verified.
- coach-ops-weekly.js: read-only Weekly Growth Digest. Pulls KPIs from
  Supabase (MRR at live prices), asks Claude for a prioritized digest
  (cite-the-KPI, no medical claims, no under-13 targeting), writes a
  kpi_snapshots row + coach_ops_runs audit row, emails admin via Resend.
  Scheduled Mon 13:00 UTC + manual admin trigger. Sends nothing to users.
- coach-ops-data.js: admin-gated reader for the Coach Ops panel.
- netlify.toml: schedule coach-ops-weekly (0 13 * * 1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
